A closed fence in a nested child leaves no paragraph open

````
- a
    - child
      ```
      x
      ```
  ~~~
after
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>child
        <pre><code>x
</code></pre>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <pre><code></code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
````

````
> - a
>     - child
>       ```
>       x
>       ```
>   ~~~
after
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
      <ul>
        <li>child
          <pre><code>x
</code></pre>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <pre><code></code></pre>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>after</p>
````

```
- a
    - # h
  ~~~
after
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <h1 id="h">h</h1>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <pre><code></code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- a
    - child
      text
  ~~~
after
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>child
text</li>
    </ul>
    <pre><code></code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
